flowchart LR
  Catalog[Generated component catalog] --> Documentation[Component documentation]
  Registry[Component and source registries] --> Catalog
  Registry --> Documentation
  Questions[Open identity and compatibility questions] --> Dormant[Dormant until a story decision needs them]
  Dormant --> Documentation
  Current[Registered family and candidate sources] --> Documentation
  Documentation --> Cited[Cited page or HTML section]
  Cited --> Manual[Complete vendor source when needed]
  Story[Dependent future story] --> Activate[Activate smallest needed question]
  Dormant --> Activate
  Activate --> Owner[Just-in-time owner observation or measurement]
  Owner --> Evidence[Append-only story evidence]
  Evidence --> Registry
  Registry --> Acquire[Exact-source acquisition]
  Acquire --> Documentation
  Documentation --> Decisions[Traceable engineering decisions]
  Evidence --> Decisions
